{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/Clouds.png?t=1740597231\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the role of an <strong>interior designer</strong> in a world in desperate need of creative touch. Bring your own and your clients' visions to life in this isometric and colorful simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start from humble beginnings in <i>Central Point</i>, and work your way up to designing grand mansions in <i>Hillside</i>. The better you perform, the more opportunities will come your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLENTY OF UNLOCKABLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each job offers something new to decorate with. Don't forget to explore the cities for hidden items and special decor pieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ICONIC ISOMETRIC ARTSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a 3D world in an isometric point of view, capturing the charm of classic games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RELAXING, YET REWARDING GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interior Tales offers a stress-free and forgiving gameplay experience while maintaining core simulation elements like an economy and progressive career development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3222920/extras/GIF.gif?t=1740597231\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3222920?t=1740597231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3222920?t=1740597231","capsule_image":"https://shared.